        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat, at heat pump, air-water, 15kW, CH electricity, in new building (proj. 210)</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat, at heat pump, air-water, 15kW, CH electricity, in new building (proj. 210)
Heat from a air-water heat pump, 15kW with Swiss electricity mix (CH). Lifetime of the heating system is 20 years. SPF=4.4. Loss of coolant is 2% (of the total amount in the system) per year.;
UUID: 67987a53-51f3-35e8-97ee-607c90bd0b38
Included are the share of the production of the air-water heatpump with a lifetime of 20years scaled for 1MJ.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: undefined
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: heat efficieny based on literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_67987a53-51f3-35e8-97ee-607c90bd0b38.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
